        {
          "id": "2079940300450021747",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-22T14:43:05.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2079940300450021747",
          "textSnippet": "Day 1 saw Burnham back the US in using UK bases to carry on its war of aggression. \n\nDay 2, we've heard his plans to saddle low-income countries with more debts. \n\nNew face, old politics. We need real change: standing up to Trump and  showing real leadership on the world stage."
        },
        {
          "id": "2079949704641511485",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-22T15:20:27.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2079949704641511485",
          "textSnippet": "Strange to be in a Labour Prime Minister sandwich. I'll be there talking about hope with a real plan for change.\n\nI'll be on stage being interviewed live in Edinburgh on Saturday 8th August at the fringe. Tickets below "
        },
        {
          "id": "2079949708315771257",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-22T15:20:28.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2079949708315771257",
          "textSnippet": "https://\nedfringe.com/tickets/whats-\non/iain-dale-all-talk-with-zack-polanski\n…"
        },
        {
          "id": "2080002308209815595",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-22T18:49:29.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2080002308209815595",
          "textSnippet": "Tinkering at the edges is not going to cut it - nor is refusing to stand up to Donald Trump.\n\nWe need rent controls, a wealth tax and a huge investment in renewables.\n\nOtherwise - it's looking like continuity Starmer."
        },
        {
          "id": "2080027137868788223",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-22T20:28:09.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/ZackPolanski/status/2080027137868788223",
          "textSnippet": "We need answers."
        },
        {
          "id": "2080029158051324231",
